# Redirects (Cloudflare Pages `_redirects`, copied verbatim into dist/).
#
# No SPA catch-all any more. Every real page is prerendered to its own
# index.html (prerender.mjs), and dist/404.html is the prerendered NotFound
# page — Cloudflare Pages serves it with a real 404 status for any path
# without a file. The old `/* /index.html 200` turned every typo into a
# 200 copy of the English homepage (a soft 404). Static tool dirs (/studio/,
# /print/, /schedule/, /event-report/, /sidework-points/) are real files and
# are served before any rule here.
#
# Canonical URLs end in a slash (/vn/, /event-guidelines/); Pages adds that
# itself with a 308, so no rule is needed for it.

# Old / guessable language prefixes → the real ones. /vn is the Vietnamese
# prefix (ISO "vi" is only used for hreflang); EN lives at the root.
/vi            /vn/          301
/vi/*          /vn/:splat    301
/en            /             301
/en/*          /:splat       301

# Guessable shortcuts → the live app, where events and the menu actually live.
/events        https://app.realitydn.com/        301
/events/       https://app.realitydn.com/        301
/menu          https://app.realitydn.com/menu    301
/menu/         https://app.realitydn.com/menu    301
